  "title": "wiretap: fix time_t use in rtpdump.c",
  "description": "Coverity CID 1524708 flags this code as an unsafe use of a `time_t`\n(which may be 64 bits). `rtpdump` only uses a 32-bit timestamps, but\nlet's read it into a `uint32_t` and fix the endianness before we put it\nin our `nstime_t` structure.",
